<title>POLAND: DOM-PLAST 96 NET RISES TO PLN 8.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>DOM-PLAST 96 NET RISES TO PLN 8.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.49 vs   0.36 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.51 vs   0.30 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.30 vs   0.19 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    4.22 vs   5.39</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.83 vs   2.60</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	16.64 vs   5.21</p>
<p> Operating profit    15.88 vs   7.76</p>
<p> Sales		   71.27 vs  78.46</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish plastoc houseware is Dom-Plast</p>
<p>SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
